{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/firstSight(_:)"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"func","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Function","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"firstSight","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto9ItemTraitV","text":"ItemTrait","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"externalID":"s:6Gnusto10firstSightyAA9ItemTraitVSSF","title":"firstSight(_:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"The paragraph used to mention the item in a room description until the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"player has touched it (ZIL’s FDESC).","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/LocationTrait","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ItemTrait","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/adjectives(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/synonyms(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/dark","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/alwaysDescribed","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/lightSource","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/startsLit","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/wearable","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/scenery","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/surface","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/container","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/openable","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/startsOpen","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/transparent"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Describing-Entities","title":"Describing Entities"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/firstsight(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func